        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Jack Handle changes the target, the hero is no longer the target of Say Cheese!</p><p>Same as Redirection effects, the original target is no longer the target. Plague Rat does not get to play an Infection card if a hero target is not damaged by his Ravage card.</p>",
